@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName IPAGothic
title AT 変速判定 / 車速とスロットル開度から推奨ギアが決まる [15] speed=25, throttle=30, gear=1
legend left
  ECUが初期化されている
endlegend
analog "車速 [km/h]" between 0 and 25 as s0
analog "スロットル開度 [%]" between 0 and 30 as s1
analog "推奨ギア (期待) [速]" between 0 and 1 as s2

@0
s0 is 25
s1 is 30
@10
s0 is 25
s1 is 30
s2 is 1
highlight 10 to 20 #Gold;line:DimGrey : 確認
@enduml
